column2:
{PORTRAIT 0x0000}{NAME 0x0280}
Welcome.\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
?!\n
Why do you have a shop\n
in a place like this?\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0000}{NAME 0x0280}
Well, being the wandering\n
merchant that I am, \n
during my travels...\n
{WAITINPUT}{SAMECHAR}
I was suddenly swallowed\n
up by a dense fog... and \n
ended up here.\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
Still, there is no need \n
for you to set up shop\n
in a place like this... \n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0000}{NAME 0x0280}
At first, I spent some\n
time looking for an exit.\n
I couldn't find one, so...\n
{WAITINPUT}{SAMECHAR}
without other options,\n
I opened up for business\n
right here...\n
{WAITINPUT}{SAMECHAR}
So what can I do for you?\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}

{PORTRAIT 0x0000}{NAME 0x0280}
So we meet again. Glad to\n
see you looking well.\n
What can I do for you?\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}

{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
Whoa, what a nice room. \n
Maybe a bit tasteless.\n
Perhaps some furniture...\n
{WAITINPUT}{SAMECHAR}
Okay, I guess I'll try \n
putting this down right \n
here!\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}

{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
Whoa, what a nice room. \n
Maybe a bit tasteless.\n
Perhaps some furniture...\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}

{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
For some reason, things \n
look a bit different than\n
they did before...\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}

{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
This is the same place I \n
was before, but the aura \n
about it has changed.\n
{WAITINPUT}{SAMECHAR}
Now I see.  This is what \n
Death meant when he said\n
there were two castles.\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}
